// versus RelaySink::emit_text_delta_async (aggregate refused retain()).
// The aggregate counter lives in the static wcore_acp::bounded::global::USED
// (file vaddr 0xb310b08); load base = ip - 0x3aa5940 at this probe.
uprobe:/root/w15-leak2/bin/fix/wayland-core:"_ZN9wcore_acp7bounded15Sender$LT$E$GT$8overload17h972145050330e7aaE"
